    "description": "Responsibilities:\n-Created and maintained Jython test tool software including call processing tools using the Sipunit Java API, web testing tools using the Selenium API and tools to test a provisioning API\n-Wrote test plans and automated Jython test cases for new features\n-Maintained a Java application that uses an OpenCloud SLEE to simulate an MSC/HLR/SMSC\n-Maintained an application used to checkout, build and deploy product software loads as well as execute lists of test cases and store the result of each test in a MySQL database (PHP web interface/Jython engine)\n-Maintained a PHP web page used to analyze runs of test cases\n-Debugged test cases belonging to myself during regression runs\n-Aided others in debugging the reason for test case failures\n\nAccomplishments:\n-Wrote a tool that emulates an ASC Call Recording Server, enabling automation testing for integration with this endpoint\n-Wrote a Jython tool built on the Smack API to emulate a Jabber XMPP IM client, enabling automation testing for integration with a Cisco IM&P Server\n-Wrote a simple Jython program to manipulate test case keywords stored in a MySQL database, which are used to control what type of lab a test case can run on\n-Updated the SLEE application and Jython tools to simulate an SMSC sending and receiving SMS text messages\n-Added a test case owner filter to the PHP web page used for run analysis, allowing better coordination when working regression runs",
